ef=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>OH</p>\n<p>Cyanide group is given the highest priority.\n<br><br>Hence, it is written as suffix benzonitrile and\nother functional groups behave as substituents.\nThe numbering of substituents is done in such\na way that sum of the locants is least.\n<br><br>The names of substituents are written in\nalphabetical order.</p>\n<img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lfxhmnir/c2dde872-125b-4e19-8519-ccbbe7da0012/ab3cfe30-d047-11ed-adb8-f5dc1908b5dc/file-1lfxhmnis.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lfxhmnir/c2dde872-125b-4e19-8519-ccbbe7da0012/ab3cfe30-d047-11ed-adb8-f5dc1908b5dc/file-1lfxhmnis.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2009 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 13 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1lfxhmnir/c2dde872-125b-4e19-8519-ccbbe7da0012/ab3cfe30-d047-11ed-adb8-f5dc1908b5dc/file-1lfxhmnis.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1lfxhmnir/c2dde872-125b-4e19-8519-ccbbe7da0012/ab3cfe30-d047-11ed-adb8-f5dc1908b5dc/file-1lfxhmnis.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lfxhmnir/c2dde872-125b-4e19-8519-ccbbe7da0012/ab3cfe30-d047-11ed-adb8-f5dc1908b5dc/file-1lfxhmnis.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1lfxhmnir/c2dde872-125b-4e19-8519-ccbbe7da0012/ab3cfe30-d047-11ed-adb8-f5dc1908b5dc/file-1lfxhmnis.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1lfxhmnir/c2dde872-125b-4e19-8519-ccbbe7da0012/ab3cfe30-d047-11ed-adb8-f5dc1908b5dc/file-1lfxhmnis.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lfxhmnir/c2dde872-125b-4e19-8519-ccbbe7da0012/ab3cfe30-d047-11ed-adb8-f5dc1908b5dc/file-1lfxhmnis.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width